{
  "_comment": [
    "Bundled phone-spec database used to fill in the touch sampling rate, which no public Android API exposes.",
    "screen_size_inches and refresh_rate_hz are published manufacturer figures; density_dpi is the reported Android bucket.",
    "touch_sampling_rate_hz values are conservative steady-state estimates: vendors quote peak rates the panel does not sustain.",
    "build_model_codes holds raw Build.MODEL strings (adb shell getprop ro.product.model) so detection matches phones that report an internal code.",
    "See README.md section 'Adding or correcting phones'."
  ],
